tore_item_assets/steam/apps/2327640/extras/3ac3eb9db6f903c2ba04fafaaa7ea8eb.mp4?t=1744583550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop Your Base</h2>Unlock new items, characters, and factions to interact with - from the ruthless Order to the all-knowing PFS. The possibilities for experimentation and creating synergies are limitless: two expeditions won\u2019t ever feel identical.",
